  "summary": "Stripe exposes a REST HTTP API at `https://api.stripe.com`, an OAuth-protected MCP server at `https://mcp.stripe.com`, and the `stripe` CLI.",
  "description": "Stripe provides online payment processing, billing, payouts, and related financial infrastructure for internet businesses. Its platform also includes tools for developers to manage payments, subscriptions, connected accounts, and other commerce workflows.",
